{"words": [{"text": "مَّن", "translation": "Who"}, {"text": "ذَا", "translation": "(is) the one"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِى", "translation": "who"}, {"text": "يُقْرِضُ", "translation": "will lend"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "(to) Allah "}, {"text": "قَرْضًا", "translation": "a loan"}, {"text": "حَسَنًۭا", "translation": "good"}, {"text": "فَيُضَـٰعِفَهُۥ", "translation": "so (that) He multiplies it"}, {"text": "لَهُۥٓ", "translation": "for him "}, {"text": "أَضْعَافًۭا", "translation": "manifolds"}, {"text": "كَثِيرَةًۭ ۚ", "translation": "many"}, {"text": "وَٱللَّهُ", "translation": "And Allah"}, {"text": "يَقْبِضُ", "translation": "withholds"}, {"text": "وَيَبْصُۜطُ", "translation": "and grants abundance"}, {"text": "وَإِلَيْهِ", "translation": "and to Him"}, {"text": "تُرْجَعُونَ", "translation": "you will be returned"}], "sahih": "Who is it that would loan Allāh a goodly loan so He may multiply it for him many times over? And it is Allāh who withholds and grants abundance, and to Him you will be returned."}